   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Tier 1: embedding k-NN\n   (52 labelled examples,\n   no LLM call, ≥ 0.75 conf)\nTier 2: gpt-oss-20b JSON\n   (hybrid split, follow-ups)\nFallback: HYBRID/parallel\n→ SQL_ONLY · VECTOR_ONLY · HYBRID",
