   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. retrieve schema cards\n   (+ FK tables, glossary)\n2. gpt-oss-120b writes SQL\n3. sqlglot guard (SELECT only,\n   tables, sensitive columns)\n4. run as read-only role + RLS\n5. error → self-repair (×3)",
   "originalText": "1. retrieve schema cards\n   (+ FK tables, glossary)\n2. gpt-oss-120b writes SQL\n3. sqlglot guard (SELECT only,\n   tables, sensitive columns)\n4. run as read-only role + RLS\n5. error → self-repair (×3)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
